  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "7b1356eb-51fc-4693-a191-b3524221afc6",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a palavra e associe \"usted\" a um tom mais formal.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "df2bab3f-7628-4a2e-8b9c-4ca2700894cb",
          "textContent": "<p>Em um atendimento ou primeiro contato mais formal, pode aparecer:</p><p><strong>usted</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>o senhor / a senhora / você em situação formal</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/998318a839c74c52987ddc6393217658_b01-formal-reception-desk.png?Expires=1794099401&Signature=hp3d3VofUqRbcK-eA3FWqixnHNDy~hGMqPNj2c~ATb6AeECCfoXHZV~oUHe6RHtqD9zhpjzdnpVsCFqaFs5wL5QYUjIwUCulB5zWECcyMmE4O4joZNnIqA-Y~dDrt7DlVKTBzUhcT2Jj1njavKLp2qvQh46lj1xGqeZA4GKKcfAe-8oyfjFYqPFcPjYEdJ-pdiJtjEVM5Jba5BLB5dbrvOieTknI8~uy7EmiKhL6mZ7thLOj1oj1i9Pyz9aPUfEM~1TK2Xv4GQoCe-KUZOhr9qPuUgrM3S7SLKobnLNOPM1u6NERVpo0hJ1iTHuIf0qZOLpkvEQ3h7Lmj6mxDntN7A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
